Package: @PKG@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Howdah Maintainers <packages@howdah.org>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: phpapi-@API@, php@MINOR@-common
Section: php
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://howdah.org
Description: Howdah defensive WAF module for PHP @MINOR@
 Howdah is an open-source, defensive web application firewall that runs inside
 PHP. It refuses abusive multipart/form-data requests (part/file floods, header
 and input-shape abuse) before PHP allocates memory for them.
 .
 This package provides the PHP @MINOR@ module (Zend module API @API@) and its
 configuration, and enables it on install in detect (log-only) mode. Licensed
 MIT or Apache-2.0.
